WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your right side with legs stacked.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach the left arm overhead along the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Optional: slide the left leg slightly back for a longer waist stretch.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the left ribs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
